    <!-- Help & About Content -->
    <string name="title_our_mission">Our Mission</string>
    <string name="msg_our_mission">At HemoScan, our mission is to empower medical professionals with cutting-edge AI technology to save lives through faster and more accurate brain hemorrhage detection. We believe that every second counts in neuro-diagnostics.</string>
    <string name="title_our_team">Our Team</string>
    <string name="msg_our_team">We are a diverse team of data scientists, neuro-radiologists, and software engineers dedicated to clinical excellence and technological innovation.</string>
    <string name="title_getting_started">Getting Started</string>
    <string name="msg_getting_started">1. Create an account with your medical credentials.\n2. Go to the Dashboard and click \'New Scan\'.\n3. Upload a brain CT image or DICOM file.\n4. Wait for the AI model to analyze the scan.\n5. Review clinical findings and share the report if needed.</string>
    <string name="title_troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</string>
    <string name="msg_troubleshooting">- Image Upload Fails: Ensure you have a stable internet connection and the file format is supported.\n- Slow Processing: AI analysis depends on scan complexity; please wait up to 30 seconds.\n- Login Issues: Use the \'Forgot Password\' link to reset your access.</string>
